<title>USA: TABLE - Richardson Electronics Ltd Q4 net.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Richardson Electronics Ltd Q4 net.</headline>
<dateline>LAFOX, Ill. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 0.15   profit	$ 0.19</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,823   profit	 2,320</p>
<p> Sales		     71,265		   64,430</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,067		   12,213</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 0.12   profit	$ 0.68</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,493   profit	 8,111</p>
<p> Sales		    255,139		  239,667</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,892		   12,002</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1997 year loss includes severance costs and special charges from re-evaluation of reserve estimates amounting to $11 million before taxes, or $6.7 millin after taxes or $0.56 a share; and extraordinary loss of $800,000 less tax benefits of $312,000 or $0.04 a share on the exchange of certain of the company's debentures.</p>
<p>Periods end May 31, 1997 and 1996, respectively.</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
